              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even today the descendants of Israel do not eat the muscle which is on the hip joint, because it was on this muscle that Jacob was struck.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
